      "filename": "Escudo Loja (Ecuador).jpg",
      "title": "File:Escudo Loja (Ecuador).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/Escudo_Loja_%28Ecuador%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
